 {id:"newsparta",name:"New Sparta",lat:4,lon:24,site:"newsparta",from:6,desc:"Atalantia’s African seat, where she pressures Lysander before the summit."},
 {id:"deepgrave",name:"Deepgrave",lat:38,lon:-38,from:4,site:"deepgrave",desc:"A prison beneath the Atlantic. Darrow’s team raids it in Iron Gold and frees Apollonius au Valii-Rath."},
 {id:"greenland",name:"Greenland base",lat:72,lon:-42,from:4,desc:"Darrow’s hidden base on Earth in Iron Gold."},
 {id:"rome",name:"Rome",lat:41.9,lon:12.5,from:6,site:"rome",desc:"The Eternal City, kept by the Society as the shrine of its empire. In Light Bringer, Atalantia convenes the Two Hundred in its Colosseum."}
