  blurb:"Far below the eye of the Discordia Sea’s great current, the Daughters of Athena hold the Deep: Helisson, a drowned city of domes and towers on the sea floor, and an old nickel mine where Athena tries Darrow and Diomedes before seven thousand armed followers.",
